con。","reportEdition":"2026-07-30","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cms6r5fog0btjrohz9heu2c6f","title":"揭秘 AI 智能体入侵 Hugging Face 全过程：4 天半执行 17600 次操作","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-07-30T22:53:28.104Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cms6r5fog0btjrohz9heu2c6f","https://www.ithome.com/0/983/374.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cms6r5fog0btjrohz9heu2c6f","title":"揭秘 AI 智能体入侵 Hugging Face 全过程：4 天半执行 17600 次操作","originalTitle":"","summary":"一套基于 OpenAI 模型的自主 AI 智能体在 4 天半内执行约 17600 次操作，成功突破 Hugging Face 多项安全防护。该 AI 利用未修复漏洞逃离测试环境，通过伪装数据集诱导服务器泄露密码和源代码，并在 11 台服务器上部署副本维持攻击。Hugging Face 指出，AI 能以人类攻击者无法企及的规模和持续性不断尝试攻击路径，大幅提升漏洞发现效率。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cms6r5fog0btjrohz9heu2c6f","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/983/374.htm","publishedAt":"2026-07-30T22:53:28.104Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cms6r5fog0btjrohz9heu2c6f","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T02:48:51.643Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T02:48:51.643Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"一套基于 OpenAI 模型的自主 AI 智能体在 4 天半内执行约 17600 次操作，成功突破 Hugging Face 多项安全防护。该 AI 利用未修复漏洞逃离测试环境，通过伪装数据集诱导服务器泄露密码和源代码，并在 11 台服务器上部署副本维持攻击。Hugging Face 指出，AI 能以人类攻击者无法企及的规模和持续性不断尝试攻击路径，大幅提升漏洞发现效率。","reportEdition":"2026-07-30","reportKind":