ells-the-frontier"],"articles":[{"id":"cms73a7ha0012ro8wknjunnhb","title":"微软转售前沿：Azure 年营收破千亿但增速被 Google Cloud 反超","originalTitle":"","summary":"Azure 上财年营收首破 1000 亿美元，同比增长 43%，但 Google Cloud 增速达 82%，几乎是 Azure 的两倍。Google 拥有自研模型与芯片，云运营利润率从 20.7% 扩至 35.6%；微软则主要依赖英伟达商用芯片，且 6780 亿美元合同 backlog 中近半数来自 OpenAI 单一客户。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cms73a7ha0012ro8wknjunnhb","originalUrl":"https://www.tomtunguz.com/microsoft-resells-the-frontier","publishedAt":"2026-07-30T22:53:28.104Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-uw5ga9","originalSourceName":"Tomasz Tunguz 博客（VC 分析）","family":"outlet-eygl44","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cms73a7ha0012ro8wknjunnhb","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T02:48:51.643Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-uw5ga9","name":"Tomasz Tunguz 博客（VC 分析）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T02:48:51.643Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"Azure 上财年营收首破 1000 亿美元，同比增长 43%，但 Google Cloud 增速达 82%，几乎是 Azure 的两倍。Google 拥有自研模型与芯片，云运营利润率从 20.7% 扩至 35.6%；微软则主要依赖英伟达商用芯片，且 6780 亿美元合同 backlog 中近半数来自 OpenAI 单一客户。","reportEdition":"2026-07-30","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cms6arcde00qfrotz12b1tfhh","title":"Similarweb 用 LangSmith 评估 AI 智能体研究报告：评分标准、忠实度检查与基线对比","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-07-30T22:53:28.104Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cms6arcde00qfrotz12b1tfhh","https://www.langchain.com/blog/how-similarweb-evaluates-long-form-agent-research-reports-with-langsmith"],"articles":[{"id":"cms6arcde00qfrotz12b1tfhh","title":"Similarweb 用 LangSmith 评估 AI 智能体研究报告：评分标准、忠实度检查与基线对比","originalTitle":"","summary":"Similarweb 使用 LangSmith 评估 AI 智能体生成的长篇研究报告，通过评分标准（rubrics）、忠实度检查（faithfulness checks）、追踪（traces）和基线对比（baseline comparisons）来系统化评测质量。该方法帮助团队量化报告准确性、减少模型幻觉，并建立可复用的评估流程。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cms6arcde00qfrotz12b1tfhh","originalUrl":"https://www.langchain.com/blog/how-similarweb-evaluates-long-form-agent-research-reports-with-langsmith","publishedAt":"2026-07-30T22:53:28.104Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-fxewmc","originalSourceName":"LangChain：Blog（RSS）","family":"outlet-1oid4k7","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cms6arcde00qfrotz12b1tfhh","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T02:48:51.643Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-fxewmc","name":"LangChain：Blog（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T02:48:51.643Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"Similarweb 使用 LangSmith 评估 AI 智能体生成的长篇研究报告，通过评分标准（rubrics）、忠实度检查（faithfulness checks）、追踪（traces）和基线对比（baseline comparisons）来系统化评测质量。该方法帮助团队量化报告准确性、减少模型幻觉，并建立可复用的评估流程。","reportEdition":"2026-07-30","reportKind":"daily"}],"total":19,"partial":false,"itemSourceCount":13,"topics":[{"topic":"模型","count":1},{"topic":"应用","count":5},{"topic":"行业","count":4},{"topic":"研究","count":1},{"topic":"开发","count":8}],"method":"AIHOT 提供选题、摘要与编排；模境保留来源与报告窗口，关